invitationBody:
{inviter} invites you to OligInvest.

Your email address is processed by {controller} solely to send this invitation and enable registration (legitimate interest). If you do not create an account, the address will be deleted within 30 days after the invitation expires. Contact details and your rights: {privacyUrl}

The invitation is valid until {expiresAt} (UTC). Single-use link:
{url}

securityNewDeviceBody:
Your OligInvest account was signed in to from a new device or a new network.

Time: {time} ({timezone})
Browser and system: {device}
Approximate network: {network}

If this was you, no action is needed. If you do not recognise this sign-in, you can end the other sessions and change your password in settings: {url}

securityFailedSignInBody:
A series of failed sign-in attempts to your OligInvest account was recorded (wrong password or TOTP code).

Attempts in the last {minutes} min: {count}
Latest attempt: {time} ({timezone})

Further attempts are slowed down, and after 5 wrong TOTP codes verification is locked for 15 minutes. If this was not you, you can change your password and review active sessions in settings: {url}
